<title>GERMANY: No comment by Swiss banks on Commerzbank talk.</title>
<headline>No comment by Swiss banks on Commerzbank talk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss banking groups on Thursday declined to comment on rumours that they were responsible for pushing up Germany's Commerzbank AG shares, which have jumped over five percent in early trading.</p>
<p>Peter Walser, spokesman for Swiss finacial group CS Holding, whose flagship bank is bank Credit Suisse, said &quot;we do not comment on rumours. We neither confirm nor deny them.&quot;</p>
<p>Spokesmen for Swiss Bank Corp. and Union Bank of Switzerland and spokesmen also declined to comment.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
